#. module: purchase_deposit_company_amount
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:purchase_deposit_company_amount.field_account_move_line__company_amount
msgid "Company Currency Amount"
msgstr "会社通貨金額"

#. module: purchase_deposit_company_amount
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_deposit_company_amount.field_purchase_order_line__deposit_company_amount
msgid ""
"Company-currency value actually booked by the posted deposit vendor bill(s) "
"for this deposit line, and zero unless one of them carries a hand-entered "
"Company Currency Amount. The final vendor bill pins its deposit-offset line "
"to this value so the deposit account closes out at the amount that was "
"really paid, whatever the exchange rate has done since."
msgstr "この前払明細について、記帳済の前払仕入先請求書が実際に計上した会社通貨での金額です。いずれの請求書にも手入力の会社通貨金額がない場合はゼロになります。最終の仕入先請求書は前払相殺明細をこの金額に固定するため、その後の為替レートの変動にかかわらず、前払勘定は実際に支払われた金額で消去されます。"

#. module: purchase_deposit_company_amount
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_deposit_company_amount.field_account_move_line__company_amount
msgid ""
"Company-currency value you actually paid for this line. When set, the line's"
" balance is forced to this amount instead of the standard amount_currency / "
"exchange_rate conversion, while the foreign-currency amount stays untouched."
" Enter it unsigned -- the debit/credit direction follows the line's foreign-"
"currency amount. Leave it empty to keep the standard conversion. Only "
"available on the deposit line of a deposit bill raised in a foreign "
"currency; every other line follows from it automatically."
msgstr "この明細について実際に支払った会社通貨での金額です。設定すると、標準のamount_currency / exchange_rateによる換算ではなく、明細の残高がこの金額に強制され、外貨金額は変更されません。符号なしで入力してください。借方/貸方の方向は明細の外貨金額に従います。空欄のままにすると標準の換算が維持されます。外貨で作成された前払請求書の前払明細でのみ利用可能で、他の明細はすべて自動的にこの値から算出されます。"

#. module: purchase_deposit_company_amount
