#. module: purchase_deposit_company_amount
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_deposit_company_amount.field_account_bank_statement_line__allow_company_amount
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_deposit_company_amount.field_account_move__allow_company_amount
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_deposit_company_amount.field_account_payment__allow_company_amount
msgid ""
"Technical field: the company-currency amount may be entered by hand on this "
"bill's deposit line."
msgstr "テクニカルフィールド: この請求書の前払明細では会社通貨金額を手入力できます。"

#. module: purchase_deposit_company_amount
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_deposit_company_amount.field_account_bank_statement_line__is_deposit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_deposit_company_amount.field_account_move__is_deposit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:purchase_deposit_company_amount.field_account_payment__is_deposit
msgid ""
"Technical field: this bill was raised by the Register Deposit wizard, i.e. "
"it books a deposit rather than netting one off. It is the only kind of bill "
"on which the company-currency amount can be entered by hand."
msgstr "テクニカルフィールド: この請求書は前払登録ウィザードで作成されたもので、前払を相殺するのではなく計上します。会社通貨金額を手入力できるのはこの種類の請求書のみです。"
